.svg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Simple Icons contributors<\/a> \/ <a class=\"content-link cover-credit-link\" href=\"https:\/\/github.com\/simple-icons\/simple-icons\/blob\/15.0.0\/icons\/typescript.svg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Simple Icons<\/a> \u2014 <a class=\"content-link cover-credit-link\" href=\"https:\/\/creativecommons.org\/publicdomain\/zero\/1.0\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CC0 1.0<\/a><\/span>\n\t<\/span>\n<\/p>\n\n\t<h2 class='center'>1. Typescript is superscript of the Javascript.<\/h2>\n\t<ol class=\"list-number content-list\">\n\t\t<li><div>Typescript is superscript of the Javascript.<\/div><\/li>\n\t<\/ol>\n\t<ol class=\"list-number content-list\">\n\t\t<li><div>Typescript compiles back to javascript.<\/div><\/li>\n\t<\/ol>\n\t<h2>3. Typescript does NOT directly run in browser<\/h2>\n\t<ol class=\"list-number content-list\">\n\t\t<li><div>It is used to generate the js that will eventually run in the browser.<\/div><\/li>\n\t<\/ol>\n\t<ol class=\"list-number content-list\">\n\t\t<li><div>DENO though is a runtime that will execute TS directly.<\/div><\/li>\n\t<\/ol>\n\t<h2>4. Classes can either have default constructor or parameterized constructor<\/h2>\n\t<ol class=\"list-number content-list\">\n\t\t<li><div>But not both.<\/div><\/li>\n\t<\/ol>\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2026 Aug 19\t\t<\/span>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class='center' id='content-body-separator'><\/div>\r\n<div id='sub-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='fb_components'>\r\n\t<div class=\"fb-comments\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/programming\/typescript\/typescript\"\n  data-numposts=\"50\">\n<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"fb-like\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/programming\/typescript\/typescript\"\n  data-layout=\"button\"\n  data-action=\"like\"\n  data-size=\"small\"\n  data-s